ion section but oxford itself  has said that marcos according to their  own records did not complete his degree  for philosophy  and economics  the situation as i see it is  the declining influence of mainstream  media  coupled with the increasing power of  social media how do we defend the truth  how do we defend democracy when  it's unclear if people understand what  that is this may be the last you know  democratic elections we'll ever have and  that thought scares me not just as a  journalist but as a young filipino  [Music]
 

